N:Verse and chorus. Melody from the vocal channel of a MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com, track 30834), moved up a fourth from G major to C major so the low G3 lands on C4. A second arrangement (track 3375) gives the same pitches apart from one grace note; where its rhythm differs by a sixteenth the first was followed, except one E in bar 11 where the second was. Left out: the second verse's extension and the bridge. Chords from the arrangement's pad and bass channels.
